.TH "PIP-LIST" "1" "Aug 05, 2026" "26.2" "pip"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pip-list \- description of pip list command
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
List installed packages, including editables.
.sp
Packages are listed in a case\-insensitive sorted order.

.SH "نحوه استفاده (USAGE)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
python \-m pip list [options]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-outdated
List outdated packages
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_OUTDATED\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-uptodate
List uptodate packages
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_UPTODATE\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-e, \-\-editable
List editable projects.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_EDITABLE\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-l, \-\-local
If in a virtualenv that has global access, do not list globally\-installed packages.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_LOCAL\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-user
Only output packages installed in user\-site.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_USER\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-path <path>
Restrict to the specified installation path for listing packages (can be used multiple times).
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_PATH\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-format <list_format>
Select the output format among: columns (default), freeze, or json. The \(aqfreeze\(aq format cannot be used with the \-\-outdated option.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_FORMAT\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-not\-required
List packages that are not dependencies of installed packages.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_NOT_REQUIRED\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-exclude\-editable
Exclude editable package from output.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_EXCLUDE_EDITABLE\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-include\-editable
Include editable package in output.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_INCLUDE_EDITABLE\fP)
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-exclude <package>
Exclude specified package from the output
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_EXCLUDE\fP)
.UNINDENT

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
pip developers
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
The pip developers
